sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant N as Next.js Server
    participant S as Supabase (DB/Auth)
    participant E as Email Service

    U->>N: Open booking page / select service
    N->>S: Query services & available slots
    S-->>N: Return slots
    N-->>U: Render available slots
    U->>N: Submit booking (customer details, slot)
    N->>S: Begin transaction: verify slot still available
    S-->>N: slot available
    N->>S: Insert booking, mark slot locked
    S-->>N: Booking created
    N->>E: Send confirmation email
    E-->>U: Email delivered
    N-->>U: Show booking confirmation
